  "narrative": {
    "text": "A screenshot of a printed device-use agreement headed with a declaration that the signer has received a handset and accessories from the Ghana Health Service. It is organized into numbered sections — Ownership, Use, Maintenance, and Loss and Theft — each containing several numbered clauses; for example, the Loss and Theft section specifies that loss must be reported immediately, describes a cost-sharing formula between the user (75%) and the Ghana Health Service (25%) for replacement due to negligence, and sets out penalties for repeated negligent loss.",
